      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$500-2,000</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Removing old deck</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$800-2,500</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Tree/stump removal</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$300-1,500 per tree</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Electrical (outlets, lighting)</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$1,000-3,500</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Built-in seating/planters</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$500-2,000</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Pergola or shade structure</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$2,000-8,000</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td31">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Skirting (to hide under-deck)</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td32">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">$3-8/linear foot</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"><b>Pro tip:</b> Get these in writing BEFORE work starts. "Oh, we'll need to do X" after demo begins is how budgets blow up.</span></p>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #0f6745; -webkit-text-stroke: #0f6745"><span class="s1"><b>Real Example: 300 sqft Composite Deck</b></span></h2>
